# 13. Execution Flow Learned

The main processor execution flow learned during Day 3 is:

```text
              ┌──────────────┐
              │      PC      │
              └──────┬───────┘
                     │
                     ▼
              ┌──────────────┐
              │ Instruction  │
              │    Memory    │
              └──────┬───────┘
                     │
                     ▼
              ┌──────────────┐
              │ Instruction  │
              │   Decoder    │
              └──────┬───────┘
                     │
              ┌──────┴──────┐
              ▼             ▼
       ┌────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐
       │ Register   │  │  Immediate   │
       │   File     │  │  Generator   │
       └─────┬──────┘  └──────┬───────┘
             │                │
             └───────┬────────┘
                     ▼
                ┌─────────┐
                │   ALU   │
                └────┬────┘
                     │
                     ▼
                  Result
                     │
             ┌───────┴───────┐
             ▼               ▼
       Data Memory        Write Back
```

This architecture forms the foundation for the complete RV32I processor.

